<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If ’tis for purity now that you sigh,</l><l>Let Jesus come into your heart;</l><l>Fountains for cleansing are flowing near by,</l><l>Let Jesus come into your heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If there’s a tempest your voice cannot still,</l><l>Let Jesus come into your heart;</l><l>If there’s a void this world never can fill,</l><l>Let Jesus come into your heart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
